# Arduino AnalogRead

In this example, we stream ADC levels from an Arduino-compatible board using a serial interface. One can use it as an external sensor to probe something and handle data processing and visualization using the Wolfram Language library:


![](/attachments/Screenshot%202025-08-25%20at%2011.01.50-fa1.png)






%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
# Arduino AnalogRead

In this example, we stream ADC levels from an Arduino-compatible board using a serial interface. One can use it as an external sensor to probe something and handle data processing and visualization using the Wolfram Language library:


![](/attachments/Screenshot%202025-08-25%20at%2011.01.50-fa1.png)

